The distributed runtime (dist/) consists solely of original project source
compiled by the TypeScript compiler. It contains no third-party runtime
components. Rendering uses the browser's native WebGL2 API; Boolean geometry,
triangulation and STEP parsing are implemented in this project.

IFC concepts and entity/attribute names follow the publicly documented
buildingSMART IFC specifications; no schema files, documentation text or
generated schema tables are included.
